65,100 L858,104\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"880\" y=\"108\" fill=\"#555\" font-size=\"22\">h₃</text></svg><div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:570px;font-size:13px;color:#666\">Residual-block schematic: <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1512.03385\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">He et al., Deep Residual Learning (2015)</a>. Layer activations: \\(\\mathbf h_\\ell\\).</div></div>",
    "title": "Deep nets and optimization"
